<title>NORWAY: Norway's jobless rate falls to 3.2 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's jobless rate falls to 3.2 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	MAY 1997  APRIL 1997   MAY 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.2	   3.4	  4.0</p>
<p> Unemployed			 71,743	76,245     88,200</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 78,068	79,543     95,865</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
